                                "sense_id": "0233fed0-0fc0-3a9d-9030-79b100fab97a",
                                "text": "Ze erkende haar karakterfouten en werkte eraan om een betere versie van zichzelf te worden.",
                                "translation": "She acknowledged her character flaws and worked on becoming a better version of herself.",
                                "english": "She acknowledged her character flaws and worked on becoming a better version of herself."
